message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "HBQ: Hierarchical Scaling Block Quantization"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of HBQ, a hierarchical scaling block quantization scheme for accurate
  and hardware-efficient LLM inference, together with the RTL processing-element designs and the
  evaluation scripts that reproduce the results in the MICRO 2026 paper.
